	(text "Expansion header J8 (fit on demand). Every signal: 330R series (MCU side) + TPD4E05U06 ESD clamp at the pin.\n330R limits a short to GND/3V3 or a 5V mis-wire to a few mA. Power pins: PTC fuse + TVS.\nPins 5-8: I2C1 + EXP_nRESET + EXP_INT for extra MCP23017 modules (addr 0x21-0x27 by jumper) or a future power board.\nSPI3: PC10 SCK, PC11 MISO, PC12 MOSI, PA15 CS. USART6: PC6 TX, PC7 RX. FDCAN1: PB8 RX, PB9 TX.\nADC: PA0 PA3 PA4 PA6 PB1 PC0 PC2 PC3. Verify AFs in CubeMX."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ecbcd189-33b9-42f9-b0a5-1df6c642acbe")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
